---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | gazza.ltd"
  description="How gazza.ltd handles your data: what the calculators do and don't collect, how advertising cookies are used, and how to opt out of personalised ads."
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a> › <span>Privacy Policy</span>
    </nav>

    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="standfirst">Last updated 3 August 2026.</p>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>The short version</h2>
      <p>
        Every calculator and tool on this site runs entirely in your
        browser. Whatever you type into a calculator, word-game field, or
        text tool is processed on your device and is never sent to, or
        stored on, our servers. We don't ask you to sign up, and we don't
        collect the numbers, letters or text you enter.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site does use cookies for advertising and, once ads are
        enabled, third-party vendors including Google may use cookies to
        serve and measure ads. That's covered in detail below.
      </p>

      <h2>Advertising cookies</h2>
      <p>
        We work with Google AdSense (or, at higher traffic, similar ad
        networks) to display ads that help keep every tool on this site
        free. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve
        ads based on your prior visits to this site and other sites on the
        internet.
      </p>
      <p>
        Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to
        serve ads based on your visits to this site and other sites. You can
        opt out of personalised advertising by visiting Google's
        <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Ads Settings
        </a>, or opt out of a range of third-party vendors' use of cookies
        for personalised advertising by visiting
        <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          aboutads.info
        </a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Other third-party ad networks we work with may also place cookies
        on your device to serve and measure ads. Where that's the case,
        we'll name the vendor here and link to their own opt-out options.
      </p>

      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We use privacy-friendly, aggregate analytics to understand which
        pages get used and roughly how much traffic the site gets. This
        does not use cookies to track you individually across other sites,
        and doesn't identify you personally.
      </p>

      <h2>Hosting</h2>
      <p>
        This site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare may process
        standard technical information (such as your IP address) as part
        of delivering the site to you and protecting it from abuse, as
        described in
        <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Cloudflare's own privacy policy
        </a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        You can control cookies through your browser settings, including
        blocking or deleting them. Doing so may affect how ads are shown to
        you but won't stop any calculator on this site from working, since
        none of them depend on cookies to function.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy can be sent to
        <a href="mailto:hello@gazza.ltd">hello@gazza.ltd</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        If this policy changes — for example when a new ad network or
        analytics tool is added — this page will be updated and the date at
        the top will change accordingly.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
